      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## demo 03 \u2014 clean plate paint-out\n\nMask it once, get a temporally stable clean plate back.\n\nA locked-off Paris plate, a car painted out with SAM3 + Wan 2.1 VACE, and the result published to Flow Production Tracking with the plate it came from recorded as its ancestor.\n\nFlattened from the core `video_wan_vace_inpainting` template (which ships the same chain inside a subgraph) and re-wired to the 1.3B model path from `video_wan_vace_outpainting`.\n\n**Models** \u2014 all Apache-2.0\n\n| file | size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors` | 4.01 GB |\n| `Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors` | 0.08 GB |\n| `umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors` | 11.4 GB |\n| `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` | 0.25 GB |\n| `sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors` | 1.65 GB |\n\n1.3B replaces the template's 14B fp16 (32.29 GB). It is 480p only and its prompt adherence is weak \u2014 fine for a provenance demo, not for a shot.\n"
      ],
      "title": "About this workflow",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
